<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Lawn Maintenance — Chief Cornerstone</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/public.css">
</head>
<body>
<%- include('../partials/nav') %>

<section class="service-hero" style="background-image:url('/images/service-lawn.jpg')">
  <div class="service-hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="container service-hero-content">
    <div class="service-hero-tag">Our Services</div>
    <h1>Lawn Maintenance</h1>
    <p>Consistent, professional care that keeps your property looking sharp year-round.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Free Quote</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="service-page-grid">
      <div class="service-page-content">
        <h2>What We Do</h2>
        <p>A well-maintained lawn doesn't happen by accident — it takes consistency, the right equipment, and someone who actually cares about the result. At Chief Cornerstone, we treat every yard like it's our own.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px">Whether you need weekly service during growing season or a bi-weekly schedule, we show up when we say we will, do the work right, and leave your property looking clean and sharp every time.</p>

        <h3 style="margin-top:36px;margin-bottom:16px">What's Included</h3>
        <ul class="service-list">
          <li>Weekly & bi-weekly mowing on your schedule</li>
          <li>Precision edging along driveways, sidewalks & beds</li>
          <li>String trimming around obstacles & fences</li>
          <li>Debris blowing from hard surfaces</li>
          <li>Clipping cleanup and haul-off</li>
          <li>Seasonal fertilization programs</li>
          <li>Weed control treatments</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="scripture" style="margin-top:36px">
          <span>"Whatever you do, work at it with all your heart, as working for the Lord."</span>
          <cite>— Colossians 3:23</cite>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-page-sidebar">
        <div class="service-sidebar-card">
          <h4>Ready to Get Started?</h4>
          <p>Contact us for a free estimate. We'll assess your property and recommend the right maintenance plan.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-green" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;margin-top:16px">Request a Free Quote</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-sidebar-card" style="margin-top:16px">
          <h4>Other Services</h4>
          <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0">
            <li style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cream-dark)"><a href="/services/landscape-design" style="color:var(--green-dark);text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem">→ Landscape Design</a></li>
            <li style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cream-dark)"><a href="/services/tree-trimming" style="color:var(--green-dark);text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem">→ Tree & Shrub Trimming</a></li>
            <li style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cream-dark)"><a href="/services/irrigation" style="color:var(--green-dark);text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem">→ Irrigation Systems</a></li>
            <li style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cream-dark)"><a href="/services/hardscaping" style="color:var(--green-dark);text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem">→ Hardscaping</a></li>
            <li style="padding:8px 0"><a href="/services/seasonal-cleanup" style="color:var(--green-dark);text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem">→ Seasonal Cleanup</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-cta">
  <div class="container" style="text-align:center">
    <h2>Ready for a Lawn You're Proud Of?</h2>
    <p>Get a free estimate from our team today.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold" style="margin-top:28px">Request a Free Quote</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
